 | `acceptReplyTraffic` | `boolean` | No | Accept reply traffic before the ingress sets are consulted. Default `true`. See [Reply traffic and conntrack](#reply-traffic-and-conntrack). |
+| `counters` | `boolean` | No | Emit traffic counters. Default `true`. Set to `false` to build the tables with no counters at all. `createTable()` drops them by itself on a kernel that refuses them, giving up as little as possible, so this only skips those attempts. |
 
